lacier, in an <a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Mines\">abandoned mine</a>, it has been said that the Cult is trying to melt the ice in there to revive demons that had been frozen during the great winter that occurred in <a href=\"#/wiki/Hrodmir\">Hrodmir</a>.\n</p><p>Hunting places on the formorgar glacier are:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Glacier%2FMammoths\">Formorgar Glacier/Mammoths</a></li>\n<li>Formorgar Glacier/Crystal Spiders</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Monsters on Formorgar Glacier</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Rabbit\"><img alt=\"Silver Rabbit\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Silver_Rabbit_d85c65.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Rabbit\">Silver Rabbit</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">15</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">0 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a> 